window.products.push({"id":274093,"name":"Diffson Automatic Touchless Soap Dispenser for Kitchen & Bathroom Countertops Stainless Steel Brushed Nickel 250ml (8oz)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Et8oQCwEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Kids don't listen when you tell them to wash their hands? Diseases spread by not washing hands! How about introducing a cool & fun way to wash their hands? Discover the Diffson Hands free Touch Free Dispenser, with smart motion sensor technology. Diffson is fingerprint resistant, simply wipe the surface with a damp cloth to keep looking like new. With its simple operation, cultivating hand washing habit for your toddlers has never been easier! Using AAA-level anti-leakage and waterproof technology to prevent soap or water to corrode circuit board. High Quality, sleek and elegant bushed nickel stainless steel dispenser helps define your kitchen theme and personal taste just as much as the color and style of your deco. As kitchen & bathroom countertop dispenser, or bring it with you on your road trips, office, public restrooms to avoid usage of unsanitized public dispensers. Setting up Diffson Autosoap is easy: Place batteries in the battery compartment (no screw required ) Place batteries in the battery compartment (no screw required ) Unlock the top cover. Unlock the top cover. Fill the liquid compartment with soap. Fill the liquid compartment with soap. To switch on, press and hold ON/OFF button for 1-2 seconds and do the same to switch off. To switch on, press and hold ON/OFF button for 1-2 seconds and do the same to switch off. Place hand under sensor (light indicator) to dispense soap. Place hand under sensor (light indicator) to dispense soap. Dispenser should always be in upright position when it is filled with soap. Dispenser should always be in upright position when it is filled with soap. Note: To change volume of soap desired, press ON/OFF button once while keeping hand under sensor. Repeat step 5 until the desired volume. There are 3 adjustable levels. Specifications: Material: Brushed stainless steel (body) and ABS plastic (base) Capacity of dispenser: 250ml Input Power: 4pcs 1.5v AAA Battery (not included) Package Contents: 1 Auto Soap Dispenser, 1 User Manual , 1 Waterproof Case Add to cart NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Et8oQCwEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Diffson","source_asin":"B01K74SA5U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274093","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K74SA5U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K74SA5U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
