window.products.push({"id":274202,"name":"Laura Ashley 4x4 Black Ornate Textured Hand-Crafted Resin Picture Frame with Easel & Hook for Tabletop & Wall Display, Decorative Floral Design Home D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DkMlpPxkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Laura Ashley decorative embellished tabletop picture frame is hard to miss in any room. It gives new splendor and joy to any picture you house within its ornate patterns. This frame weaves vaguely leaflike figures into swirls with an antique Roman feel. A gorgeous frame design that draws attention to whatever photo is inside, whether professional wedding day pictures or casual childhood memories. Your memories will remain safe and secure in this frame -- the easy-flip tabs secure the photo or artwork in place once the back is closed. For anyone who enjoys the sentimental value of a picture, this exquisite romantic Victorian frame is a practical and meaningful gift option for friends and loved ones to display and spotlight their fondest memories. Whether you’re looking for a gift for a birthday, anniversary, housewarming, wedding, new job, or just the holidays, this frame’s sleek combination of emotional appeal, household use, and decorative flexibility make it a lovely giftable option for any girl or women in your life - mother, grandmother, daughter, sister, aunt, girlfriend etc. This essential piece is easy to fit anywhere in your home. The eloquent sophisticated design comprising this photo frame make your cherished fond memories impossible to miss in any room. Try it on your desk, atop an end table or TV stand, on corner shelves, or at one end of a well-stocked bookshelf. Alternatively, mount it to the wall for a brilliant collage of happy photos. No matter where in your house you place it, this frame will both bring new life to your favorite photo and add extra decorative flair to any room. This chunky chic resin picture frame comes with a stand that keeps your photo steady while orienting it. You can pull the kickstand easel out to secure your frame in either portrait or landscape mode, giving you a full diversity of photo options to showcase with this versatile frame","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DkMlpPxkL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Laura Ashley","source_asin":"B07T324PC2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274202","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T324PC2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T324PC2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
