window.products.push({"id":274441,"name":"Farmhouse Funny Bathroom Decor Signs, Farmhouse Block Decoration Four-Sided Funny Signs Modern Rustic Decor,Wooden Cute Guest Art Home Decorations Res","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OYAj+19vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FUNNY BATHROOM BLOCKS: The 6-sided Blocks bathroom decors have funny signs on: restroom, would poop here again, wash, put the seat down, hello sweet cheeks, wipe, please seat yourself, shower together, plush. Besides that, there are 3 images there too. It’s fun to see how everyone switches the wording around. A good way to make the guests laugh out loud, which is so relaxing! It never gets boring to use the bathroom with a little touch of humor! PERFECT DECORATIVE ADDITION: The cute and naughty bathroom blocks with plant will add a nice touch to your guest bathroom decors. The cubes are just adorable, perfect for your half bathroom, restroom, guest bathroom, toilet, washroom, toilet tank, bathroom table, countertop, and floating shelves, etc. FARMHOUSE BATHROOM DECORS: the wooden cute bathroom sign decor can go well with your all kinds of decors and the furniture in the bathroom. The simple and unique design is easily fit in with farmhouse, rustic and modern styles. The life-like potted plant makes a plus too. And the bathroom decor can be placed on the wood riser. DURABLE&EASY TO CLEAN: The funny bathroom signs are made of wood that is well painted and finished. Hand-sanding is applied on surfaces, smooth without rough edges. Letters and images will not fade away with time goes by. And it’s super easy to keep it clean. A dry cloth can wipe away the dust on it, that’s easy! ADORABLE GIFT: The funny bathroom decor sign set is a perfect gift for the Fools Day, Christmas, Mothers Day, Fathers Day, Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, New Year, Housewarming, parties, and etc. Better buy yourself one because you are going to want to keep it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OYAj+19vL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Liswit","source_asin":"B0BLLK5FGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLLK5FGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLLK5FGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
