window.products.push({"id":274443,"name":"Oh, Susannah Bonsoir Unique Funky Cool French Pillowcase (2 20x30 Standard Size Pillow Case)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M55HuscML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOR A STYLISH COUPLE! A set of two (2) 20\" x 30\" Oh Susannah white funky and cool His and Hers couples pillowcases that features the French word “Bonsoir” meaning \"Good Evening\". Redecorate your bed with these two pillowcases that have \"bon\" on the left pillow case and \"soir\" on the right case. Fits 20x30 inches standard and queen pillow inserts. Together they are a perfect match! This is the perfect gift for any classy and cultured man or woman! SUPER SOFT - Oh, Susannah uses top quality material, 120 Gram, Silky Soft microfiber fabric in all our pillowcases. And we use a permanent fiber dyeing process that leaves the decoration SOFT and BREATHABLE so you can sleep on the decoration and not even feel it. This is NOT a scratchy screen print on cheap paper thin cotton. You will love SLEEPING on these pillowcases just as much as looking at them. EXTREMELY DURABLE AND SAFE - Digital Dye Process Means Design will never fade. Machine washable, quick drying, and wrinkle resistant. BUY 3 SAVE 25% - We love our customers and want them to love us too. If you buy 3 or more Oh, Susannah pillowcases (any design) you immediately save 25% at checkout (no coupon necessary). Options for weddings, birthdays, anniversary, graduation, kids room, dorm, pillowcase fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M55HuscML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oh, Susannah","source_asin":"B07CNX16LM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CNX16LM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CNX16LM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
