window.products.push({"id":274797,"name":"Soniclean Soft Carpet Upright Vacuum Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b3v84i1nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Developed with the leading global manufacturer of premium carpet. Designed to easily and properly clean all types of soft style carpets with pile lengths less than 1 inch. The only vacuum to use patented SONIC CARPET CLEANING TECHNOLOGY. The sonic bar on the bottom of the vacuum produces 200 vibrations per second of high frequency sonic energy that dislodges the deeply embedded dirt and particulate in the carpet pile. Ultra-soft bristle brushroll, designed to be extra gentle on carpet fibers. Patented EZ-Push adjustable vent system and lightweight design (weighs only 10.5lbs) allows the vacuum to be easily pushed and pulled across thick carpets. Hospital-grade H13 HEPA filtration system captures 99.97% of particles down to 0.3 microns in size - ideal for allergy sufferers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b3v84i1nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Soniclean","source_asin":"B00W2994WM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274797","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W2994WM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W2994WM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":274798,"name":"96 Bottle Modular Wine Rack Freestanding Floor Wine Holder, Stackable Wine Storage Rack Display Shelves, Solid Wood - Wobble-Free (96 Bottles)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":73.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O91GZni0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No 🍷【Premium Wood - Sturdy and Wobble-Free】Made of high quality pine wood to ensure sturdy construction and large capacity.The thickness of this hardwood is about 18mm, smooth and durable to keep your wines in good and safe condition, 100% wobble-free guarantee! Great investment for your home wine brewing. 🍷【Modular Design - Stackable and Functional】Versatile modular stacking style, wave shaped shelves, arc design prevent wine bottles scattered around, inter lock each connection point. Unfinished wood gives option to stain, paint, varnish or leave as it is. In assembly mode, compared to the standard wine rack, metal rods and parts that don't often align with a non rigid structure, this rack snaps together with precision and speed. 🍷【Minimal Assembly Required - No Screws or Hardware 】Each piece of wood has notches so they can fit together well. No tools are required, pieces simply fit together like blocks and locks in place,a slight angle for the cork to be wet and keeps your wine fresh. The joints may tight so we suggest to use a rubber mallet to pound it together gently( mallet not included). 🍷【Ample Capacity -96 Bottle Standard Size】This wine rack only apply to the 750ml standard size wine bottles like Bordeaux and Port Bottle, NOT applicable to the Burgundy, German Flute and Sparkling Bottles. Classic design to accent any home, kitchen, dining room, or wine cellar. Also makes a great gift for any special occasion. Wine collectors will definitely love this wine rack! 🍷【Overall Dimension and WARRANTY】Approx.44.57\"(W) X 11.4\"(D) X 37.4\"(H). Holds up to 96 bottles (8 layers & 12 bottles each layer); Spacing between bars of wine rack is 6.3'', will hold standard size wine bottle (750ML). Perfect to store a lot of wine bottles, is an awesome organization system. Comes with 1 yeat limited warranty, please feel free to contact us any time for any question you might have.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O91GZni0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smartxchoices","source_asin":"B07VYS7MYM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VYS7MYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VYS7MYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
