window.products.push({"id":274838,"name":"10000mAh Rechargeable Portable Fan with LED Lantern, 8-Inch Battery Operated USB Fan, Clip on Fan, Strong Airflow, 360°Pivot, Sturdy Clamp, Hanging Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812tV9CZlvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【LONG BATTERY LIFE】Comes with 10000mAh battery that provides 5-52 hours operation with full charge based on how you use the fan and light settings. This fan supports 5V-2A fast charging, which can be fully charged within 6.5 hours. The fan/light can work on the lowest setting while charging or plugging in offers an entire day coolness and lighting. 【POWERFUL & QUIET AIRFLOW】Equipped with upgraded brushless motor and 3 high-end aerodynamic blades, This fan serves the purpose of strong airflow by producing up to 11.8 ft/s air movement but low noise and energy consumption. 3 speed options to customize your comfort. Note: The fan can only work at low speed during charging 【ULTRA BRIGHT LED LANTERN】Built-in LED lantern which is composed of 36 super bright LED lamp beads, it emits up to 740 lux light intensity, lighting up the entire space immediately. It offers 3 brightness settings, which provides the ideal light source for camping, or emergency light in case of blackout. 【360°PIVOT & TIMER FEATURE】 3 timers with auto shut-off setting (1H, 2H and 5H) are available to customize your own time for cooling and lighting. A 360° vertical and horizontal pivoting head enables to cool you down and light up your space instantly in whichever direction you like. Perfect for camping, hiking, nighttime barbecue, fishing, etc. 【VERSATILE USE】 Equipped with a study clamp and a foldable hanging hook at the bottom of the base, this 8 inch rechargeable battery-operated tent fan for clip-on, hanging or tabletop use. Hang in a tent, clip on the tent poles, or stand-up on a table. A necessary gear for camping, traveling, golf cart, home, office, RV, and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812tV9CZlvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITWLEMEN","source_asin":"B0BNMQDV6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNMQDV6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNMQDV6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
