window.products.push({"id":274855,"name":"OWENIE Thanksgiving Table Runner, Pumpkin Fall Table Runner, Fall Decor for Home with Harvest Sunflowers Pumpkins, Cutwork Applique Embroidered Center","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qBWNwGC5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[FEATURE]--Fall harvest table runners combinated autumn colors with unique lurxrey pumpkins and sunflowers with embroidery and hand cutwork, decorated with maple leaves, makes this runner elegant and high-quality. Intricate cutouts along the edges are the perfect finishing touch. Classic colors in green, yellow, orange, white and burgundy are not easy to fade, easy to match your autumn home decoration, add a thanksgiving atmosphere to your home. [GOOD QUALITY]--These thanksgiving table runners are made of 100% polyester fabric. Made by our Oeko-Tex certified factory. Most of the maple leaves are appliqué, with allover embroidery and cutwork, subtle and not too flashy. Good quality giving a long lasting use. Could be used for all the autumn season. [MULTI-FUNCTION]--These fall thanksgiving table runners perfect for home kitchen dining room table centerpieces autumn decorations. And also suit for the living room, bedroom, shabby chic, farmhouse, rustic, barn, woodland, vint table. Good for everyday use, garden, parties, Easter, Fall Harvest, Thanksgiving day, holidays etc. [SIZE]--The thanksgiving table runner sold as 1 piece 13 inch x 54 inch. Various sizes and shapes of matching placemats and runners are aviailable, for your easy collocation and docoration. Matching Table runners and placemats are sold separately, it is recommended to buy together for more beautiful effect. [EASY TO CLEAN]--Suitable for hand or machine washing. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low. cool iron as needed. Good quality could be used multiple times.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qBWNwGC5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OWENIE","source_asin":"B093W5PZQ5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093W5PZQ5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093W5PZQ5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
