window.products.push({"id":274938,"name":"Folkulture Bathroom Rugs or Bath Mats for Bathroom, Polyester Bathmat or Shower Mat, 24\" X 17\" Non Slip Tub Mat or Farmhouse Bathrug, Small Boho Bathr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WuNzto9+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ SOFT AND SHAGGY ] - Our bath mat for home is constructed with thousands of soft threads. Just sink your toes into these ultra gentle boho bath mat. It will definitely sooth your tired foot and protect it from from the cold and wet floor. [ ANTI-SLIP BACKING ] - With high-quality rubber coating that grips perfectly onto your bathroom tiles, these cute bath mat protect you and your family from any potential slips or fall in the bathroom. NOTE: Place the boho bathroom rug on a clean, dry, and flat surface only. Water under the rug can cause it to slip. Always keep the bottom of the shower mat dry. [ ULTRA ABSORBENT AND DURABLE ] - The materials in these shower rug will protect the floor from dripping water while you're stepping out of the bath, shower, or getting ready by the sink. Moisture is trapped in the bath mat set layers, allowing it to dry quickly. [ PERFECT GIFT ] - Our plush and premium shower floor mat are great for bathroom, vanity, vacation home, master bathroom, kids bathroom, guest suite. Make it a unique gift for your friends and family for housewarmings, birthdays, anniversaries and other special occasions. [ WASHCARE - Machine Washable ] - Simple care for our cotton bath rugs is enough. Machine wash with cold water and mild detergent (no chlorine or bleach) and tumble dry at a low speed or hang dry. The color of the teal bathroom rug will not fade and stay vibrant for many years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WuNzto9+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Folkulture","source_asin":"B0BSF4KXNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSF4KXNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSF4KXNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
