window.products.push({"id":274973,"name":"14 Packs Wine Bottle Protector Sleeve, Glass Bottles Bubble Cushion Wrap Bags, Inflatable Air Column Cushion Packaging Wine Bags for Luggage, Airplane","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vwhEgPeSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The inflatable wine sleeve is designed with cap and it will fully protect your wine bottle or any other fragile items. Our wine bags are all-round protection design, no breakage, no spills and no worries. Anti-schock glass bottles packaging bags can easily stored in suitcases and backpacks, traveling with your favorite drinks! Perfect for wine lovers or wine tourist. Full Package Protection, leak-proof design without risk. The bottle protector has better cushion and protection from bumping, impacting and extruding. The air columns are all independent, one broke will not have any impact on other columns. After inflating, it can't deflate and will last a long time and you can use it repeatedly. How to use? Step 1: Find the fill port. If you look along the edge of the bag, you will see a line of arrows. Check the very end by the beginning point for the arrows. Step 2 : Then Work the channel open by rubbing the plastic together to get it to separate. (the channel is above the arrow areas) Step 3 : Insert the pump tip, and pump for several times. Step 4 : Complete, place the wine bottle or similar size goods in bag. Specification: Material:high quality PE / PA Color: transparent Size and quantity: 8 * Small Air Filled Glass Bottle Protective Wrap: diameter 8 cm, height 20 cm (used for packaging and protecting honey jam glass bottles) 4 * Medium Air Filled Glass Bottle Protective Wrap: 10 cm in diameter and 28 cm in height (used to protect cocktail bottles and milk powder cans) 2 * Large Wine Bottle Protector: 8 cm in diameter and 35 cm in height (used to protect wine bottles) Package Included: 14 x inflatable air glass bottles protector bags 1 x hand pump inflator","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vwhEgPeSL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UAbby-US","source_asin":"B09JYJXHP7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-274973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JYJXHP7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JYJXHP7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
